<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - April 24.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - April 24.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to Southampton, Tewkesbury, Avonmouth and Gloucester May 114.00 Jun 115.00</p>
<p>    Feed wheat to Norfolk/Suffolk May 99.00/100.00    Avon May</p>
<p>99.00 Jun 100.00</p>
<p>East Devon May 99.00 Jun 100.00</p>
<p>Tilbury Apr 97.50</p>
<p>Shorpshire/Cheshire May 99.50/99.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Avon Jan/Mar 102.00</p>
<p>Shropshire/Cheshire Apr 95.00</p>
</text>
